The spdx-ids.json data is derived from the enum array in the official
CycloneDX 1.6 SPDX identifier schema:
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CycloneDX/specification/1.6/schema/spdx.schema.json

Source project: CycloneDX (OWASP Foundation and contributors).
